{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InterAccountTransfers\">Inter Account Transfers</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Automatic Count Create Is On Pending To ToDate Transfer\">The <strong>Pending Inter-account Transfers</strong> screen displays recurring transfers that are scheduled to be automatically created.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Bank_account BankAccount Count Is On To ToDate Transfer\">These are transfers between <em>bank accounts</em> and <em>cash accounts</em> that have been set up to occur on a regular basis.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Create Date On To ToDate Transaction Transfer\">When the scheduled date arrives, the system will automatically create the transfer transaction.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Column Create Date Is IssueDate Next NextIssueDate On To ToDate Transfer\">The <strong>Next Issue Date</strong> column shows when each recurring transfer is scheduled to be automatically created.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action Actual Count Date Is On Rate Transaction Transfer\">On this date, the system will generate the actual transfer transaction between the specified accounts.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PaidFrom\">Paid from</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PaidFrom\">Paid from</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Column Count From FromDate Is On Paid PaidFrom Transfer\">The <strong>Paid From</strong> column displays the source account from which funds will be transferred.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Count Create Credit Edit Is Transfer\">This is the account that will be credited (reduced) when the transfer is created.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ReceivedIn\">Received in</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ReceivedIn\">Received in</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Column Count Deposit HasWhere Is On Received ReceivedIn\">The <strong>Received In</strong> column displays the destination account where funds will be deposited.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Count Create Debit Is Transfer\">This is the account that will be debited (increased) when the transfer is created.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Description Narration On Transfer\">The <strong>Description</strong> column shows the description or narration for each recurring transfer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Create Is On To ToDate Transaction Transfer\">This text will be included in the transfer transaction when it is automatically created.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Amount Column Count Currency Is On To ToDate Transfer\">The <strong>Amount</strong> column displays the amount to be transferred in the currency of the source account.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Count Create Currencies ExchangeRate Is On Rate Rent Transfer\">If the source and destination accounts use different currencies, the <em>exchange rate</em> will be applied when the transfer is created.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "pending-inter-account-transfers"
}
